# The HOA page's problem levels: one dashed line per trend (sd:4969).
#
# Copy this file to <config>/project-dashboard/hoa-thresholds.conf and edit it
# (<config> is $SYSTEM_TOOLS_CONFIG, default ~/.config/system). The levels
# describe one water system, so the real values stay outside the checkout.
# Without the file every trend says "no problem level set".
#
# Pipe-separated, one level per trend:
#
#   <series>|below|<number>     a day whose low is under the number is beyond it
#   <series>|above|<number>     a day whose high is over the number is beyond it
#
# <series> is tank (ft), runtime (A2 pump hours a day) or aquifer (ft). A day
# beyond the level is drawn in the warning state. A line the page cannot read
# is named on the page and skipped; replace change-me with a number.

tank|below|change-me
